  s02: <
    handle: "custom-boof/02"
    type: "custom-boof"
    excerpt: "The incomplete maps had led her here—the grove beyond the last honest furrow, a place the town labeled as reserve growth and the workers called the listening thicket. Every step pressed a different fragment from the l..."
