    handle: "custom-boonberry/03"
    type: "custom-boonberry"
    excerpt: "The berries here did not shine for distribution. They shone like grains under stress—bright when a phrase repeated often enough to become policy, dim when the thicket put them back to sleep. Boof recognized several of..."
